### Eliminar (borrado lógico) una imagen de la unidad — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/deleteImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/deleteImage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageId": 1
}

### UnitId inválido (0) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/deleteImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 0,
  "imageId": 1
}

### ImageId inválido (0) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/deleteImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageId": 0
}

### Sin imageId (campo requerido faltante) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/deleteImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1
}

### WD-2050: unidad inexistente o fuera del scope del partner → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/deleteImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 999999999,
  "imageId": 1
}

### WD-2050: imagen inexistente para la unidad (antes respondía 200 sin borrar nada) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/deleteImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageId": 999999999
}
